        "sendTo": "abdtariq3274@gmail.com",
        "subject": "=Post Ready to Publish — {{ $json.title }}",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; color: #111;\">\n\n<h2 style=\"color: #1a1f3a; border-bottom: 3px solid #6366f1; padding-bottom: 10px;\">Today's Posts Are Ready to Publish</h2>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n  <tr><td style=\"color:#6b7280; width:120px; padding: 4px 0;\"><strong>Date:</strong></td><td>{{ $json.date }}</td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"color:#6b7280; padding: 4px 0;\"><strong>Day:</strong></td><td>{{ $json.dayName }}</td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"color:#6b7280; padding: 4px 0;\"><strong>Category:</strong></td><td>{{ $json.category }}</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n{{ $json.imageUrl ? '<img src=\"' + $json.imageUrl + '\" style=\"width:100%; max-width:640px; border-radius:8px; margin-bottom:24px; display:block;\" />' : '' }}\n\n<hr style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin: 24px 0;\">\n\n<h3 style=\"color: #4f46e5; margin-bottom: 6px;\">LinkedIn Post</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #9ca3af; font-size: 13px; margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">Go to <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/\" style=\"color:#4f46e5;\">linkedin.com/feed</a> → Start a post → paste this → add image if you want</p>\n<div style=\"background: #f5f3ff; border-left: 4px solid #6366f1; padding: 20px; border-radius: 4px; white-space: pre-line; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7;\">\n{{ $json.linkedInPost }}\n</div>\n\n<hr style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin: 24px 0;\">\n\n<h3 style=\"color: #059669; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Contra Post</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #9ca3af; font-size: 13px; margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">Go to <a href=\"https://contra.com\" style=\"color:#059669;\">contra.com</a> → your profile → Create Post → paste this</p>\n<div style=\"background: #f0fdf4; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 20px; border-radius: 4px; white-space: pre-line; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7;\">\n{{ $json.contraPost }}\n</div>\n\n<hr style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin: 24px 0;\">\n\n<div style=\"background: #f3f4f6; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; font-size: 14px;\">\n  <strong>After you post:</strong><br>\n  Open <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1IwKjyPCJ0tGpFpRceUxQwGACf9Uk0IZoSsoXqJyAAjY\">Google Sheets → Post Log</a> and change Status from <code>ready</code> → <code>posted</code>. You can also paste the LinkedIn post URL in the \"LinkedIn Post URL\" column.\n</div>\n\n<p style=\"color: #d1d5db; font-size: 11px; margin-top: 30px;\">Sent by your n8n evening workflow · Trilles AI</p>\n</div>",
